    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RE/MAX Property Specialists are delighted to present No. 88 Upper Yellow Road to the market, a well located four bedroom home offering generous accommodation, excellent outdoor space and superb convenience close to Waterford City Centre.\r\n\r\nSet in an established residential area, No. 88 offers a practical and flexible layout that will appeal to a wide range of purchasers. The ground floor includes a living room, kitchen, bathroom and a versatile additional room which is ideally suited as a fourth bedroom, home office, playroom or study.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three bedrooms, completing the accommodation.\r\n\r\nA major feature of this property is its central and convenient location. A wide range of shops, schools and everyday amenities are within easy reach, including the Hyper Centre, while Waterford City Centre is also within walking distance. Regular bus services operate nearby, providing further convenience for access throughout the city.\r\n\r\nSETU Waterford, Waterford Industrial Estate and a number of major employment and educational centres are also easily accessible.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a generous enclosed rear garden offering excellent space for families, entertaining or simply enjoying the outdoors. To the front is an attractive garden with a stepped pathway leading to the entrance, while on-street parking is available nearby.\r\n\r\nWith its generous accommodation, flexible layout, spacious garden and highly convenient location, No. 88 Upper Yellow Road represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families or investors seeking a home close to the heart of Waterford City.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from gas-fired central heating and has a D energy rating.\r\n\r\nThese particulars do not constitute an offer or contract, and whilst every effort has been made in preparing all descriptions, dimensions, maps, and plans, these details should not be relied upon as fact. Dimensions / Illustrations are for guideline purposes only and not to scale. RE/MAX Property Specialists - Team fogarty will not hold itself responsible for any inaccuracies contained therein"
      },
